// A. One-Time Static Screen-Space Application
// Calculates the equivalent local tolerance at current camera position and updates geometry once.
tiger.applyPixelTolerance(0.5);

// B. Enable Dynamic Camera-Tracking Adaptive LOD
// Continuously monitors camera zoom and updates mesh resolution automatically.
tiger.setAdaptivePixelTolerance(1.0, 0.5, { minTolerance: 0.0001, maxTolerance: 10.0 });

// C. Disable Dynamic Camera Tracking
// Freezes the geometry at its current tessellation resolution.
tiger.disableAdaptivePixelTolerance();

// D. Pure Math Query
// Computes what local tolerance corresponds to a target screen pixel error.
